OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people 'unaware' of
OL,4,Aapprenticeship options
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and young people say advice
OL,7,Fabout apprenticeships should be easier
OL,8,Fto find to help reduce the number of
OL,9,Fpeople not in education, employment or
OL,10,Ftraining (Neets).
OL,12,FLast week's Alan Milburn report
OL,13,Fsuggested different ways on how to
OL,14,Freduce the number of Neets in the UK -
OL,15,Fthought to be just under one million
OL,16,Fearlier this year - but apprentices in
OL,17,FBath argue the resources and
OL,18,Fopportunities already exist.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
