OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people 'unaware' of
OL,4,Aapprenticeship options
OL,5,
OL,6,FOliver Coombs, 20, an apprentice
OL,7,Fengineer at BIMTek, said had he not
OL,8,Fgone to a careers fair, he "wouldn't
OL,9,Fhave known an apprenticeship was an
OL,10,Foption".
OL,12,FThe government said schools should
OL,13,Finclude vocational options in careers
OL,14,Fadvice, and that it was creating 50,000
OL,15,Fnew youth apprenticeships.
